    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer and Valuer is delighted to present for sale this fabulous three bedroom semi detached property situated in one of Carrigaline's most popular developments.  \r\n\r\nThe property is in immaculate condition throughout having been superbly maintained and very well presented by its current owners. It boasts a lovely private rear garden that features an extensive patio area. It has excellent privacy benefiting hugely from being situated in a quiet cul-de-sac location.\r\n\r\nThe property is most conveniently located within walking distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline town centre. It is just a short commute to Douglas, Cork Airport, Cork City Centre & Ringaskiddy.  \r\n\r\nViewing of this ideal starter home comes highly recommended to truly appreciate what is on offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.54m x 1.88m \r\nWooden floor, carpet stairway, centre light, wooden front door with glazing. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 5.51m x 3.6m \r\nWooden/Tile flooring fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, electric hob, overhead stainless-steel extractor unit, tile splashback, centre lights/spotlights, sliding door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.53m x 0.77m \r\nWC, WHB, centre light. \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.51m x 4.98m \r\nWooden floor, wall panelling, open fireplace with surround, built-in shelving and storage units, centre light. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - 2.97m x 2.06m \r\nWooden floor, access to overhead attic, hot press unit with shelving. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.54m x 2.81m \r\nWooden floor, built-in wardrobe unit, window blind, centre light. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 2.41m x 0.93m \r\nWooden floor, electric shower unit with enclosure, WHB, fitted wall mirror, WC, centre light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.36m x 3.26m \r\nWooden floor, built-in wardrobe unit, centre light, window blind. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.37m x 2.52m \r\nWooden floor, built-in wardrobe unit, centre light. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.04m x 2.23m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, bath unit, WC, WHB, centre globe light. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: c.90sq metres (968 sq ft)\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors \r\nExcellent condition throughout \r\nReady for immediate occupation\r\nEasy access to a regular public bus service available at the entrance to the park\r\nClose to all local amenities & services in Carrigaline\r\nShort commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Cork, continue through the Shannonpark roundabout heading into Carrigaline. Turn right at the first set of traffic lights directly across the road from the new housing development \"Janeville\". Upon entering the estate, take your 2nd left and continue towards the end of the road.  No.7 is located on the right handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode: P43 DK63"
      }
